        '               expression="SUM(\'ofceKitTotCostAmt1Value\') * SUM(\'kitSum1Value\') ;" textAlign="right" displayFormat="#,##0" readOnly="true"/><w2:column xmlns:w2="http://www.inswave.com/websquare"                              ' +
